# Design mockups — authored in the claude.ai design project and exported locally.
# Untracked deliberately: 8.7 MB of generated artifacts whose source of truth lives
# upstream. Re-export into docs/mockups/ to run the fidelity harness
# (apps/admin/playwright.config.ts serves this directory on :8890).
docs/mockups/

# Keep Tauri app icons (override the *.png ignore above)
!apps/desktop/src-tauri/icons/*.png

